        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SD-SIG403-630  Contemporary Two Tone Stainless Steel Shower Handles</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese contemporary designed 9-1/4\" high shower door handles are made of solid stainless steel by AHI Hardware, a leader in stainless door hardware. Two tone finish - bright Polished Stainless grip handle with Satin Stainless ends for a truly eye catching design.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe round Polished Stainless grip handle is a comfortable 1\" diameter. \r\nPackaged with glass shower door mounting kit.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-19-specifications.gif?v=1704354684\" width=\"400\" height=\"375\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI Sigma 403 Stainless Shower handles\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for AHI SD-SIG403 Two Tone Shower Handles\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 235 mm (9-1/4\")</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 210 mm (8-1/4\") C/C</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 64 mm (2-1/2\")</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 25 mm (1\") Round</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Polished/Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Packaged with 2 door handles and includes all the hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Pull Handles)</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>**This item is discontinued</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
